title: Select_Rod_to_Upgrade
---
<<set $rodCurrentLevel = getRodCurrentLevel()>>
<<set $rodMaxLevel = getRodMaxLevel()>>
<<if $rodCurrentLevel <= 0>>
    Bruno : You don't have a fishing rod to upgrade! Go catch one first. #line:rod_no_rod
    -> Oh, okay. #line:rod_no_rod_back
        <<jump Bruno_Upgrade>>
<<elseif $rodCurrentLevel >= $rodMaxLevel>>
    Bruno : Your rod is already at the maximum level (Level {$rodMaxLevel})! #line:rod_max_level
    -> Thanks anyway. #line:rod_max_level_back
        <<jump Bruno_Upgrade>>
<<else>>
    <<set $rodUpgradeCost = getRodUpgradeCost()>>
    <<set $newRodName = getRodNameAtLevel($rodCurrentLevel + 1)>>
    <<set $newRodTier = getRodTierAtLevel($rodCurrentLevel + 1)>>
    Bruno : I can upgrade your rod from Level {$rodCurrentLevel} to Level {$rodCurrentLevel + 1} ({$newRodName}, Tier: {$newRodTier}). That'll be {$rodUpgradeCost} coins. #line:rod_upgrade_offer
    -> Here you are. #line:rod_upgrade_yes
        <<set $rodUpgradeOk = false>>
        <<canTryUpgradeRod>>
        <<set $rodUpgradeOk = canUpgradeRodSuccess()>>
        <<if $rodUpgradeOk>>
            <<set $newRodName = getRodNameAtLevel($rodCurrentLevel + 1)>>
            <<set $newRodTier = getRodTierAtLevel($rodCurrentLevel + 1)>>
            Bruno : Perfect! Your rod is now a {$newRodName} (Tier: {$newRodTier}) at Level {$rodCurrentLevel + 1}! #line:rod_upgrade_success
            -> Nice! #line:rod_upgrade_success_back
                <<jump Bruno_Upgrade>>
        <<else>>
            <<set $failReason = rodUpgradeFailReason()>>
            <<if $failReason == "not_enough_money">>
                Bruno : You don't have enough coins for that upgrade. #line:rod_not_enough_money
            <<elseif $failReason == "no_rod">>
                Bruno : Hmm, I don't see a rod on you anymore. #line:rod_no_rod_anymore
            <<elseif $failReason == "max_level">>
                Bruno : That rod is already at max level! #line:rod_already_max
            <<else>>
                Bruno : Something went wrong with the upgrade. #line:rod_generic_fail
            <<endif>>
            -> Let me try again. #line:rod_retry
                <<jump Select_Rod_to_Upgrade>>
            -> Never mind. #line:rod_cancel
                <<jump Bruno_Upgrade>>
        <<endif>>
    -> I'll pass. #line:rod_upgrade_no
        <<jump Bruno_Upgrade>>
<<endif>>
